---
import { countryName, formatDateRange, formatPredicate } from "../../../../src/site/format.ts";
import { choose, languageFromParam, languagePaths, ui } from "../../../../src/site/i18n.ts";
import { atlasRows } from "../../../../src/site/read-model.ts";
import NodeLink from "../../components/NodeLink.astro";
import T from "../../components/T.astro";
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { href } from "../../lib/links.ts";
import { BUCKETS, colorFor, EMPTY_COLOR, renderMap } from "../../lib/map.ts";
import { getModel } from "../../lib/model.ts";

export const getStaticPaths = () => languagePaths();
const lang = languageFromParam(Astro.params.lang);
const c = (it: string, en: string) => choose(lang, it, en);
const model = getModel();
const rows = atlasRows(model).sort((a, b) =>
  countryName(a.code, lang).localeCompare(countryName(b.code, lang), lang),
);
const located = new Map(rows.map((r) => [r.code, r.located.length]));
const maps = [
  { id: "europe", title: c("Europa", "Europe"), map: renderMap(located, "europe") },
  { id: "world", title: c("Mondo", "World"), map: renderMap(located, "world") },
];
const unplaced = model.events.filter(
  (e) => e.record_type === "event" && e.geography !== null && e.places.length === 0,
);
const legend = [
  { color: EMPTY_COLOR, label: "0" },
  ...BUCKETS.map((b) => ({
    color: b.color,
    label:
      b.max === Number.POSITIVE_INFINITY
        ? `${b.min}+`
        : b.min === b.max
          ? `${b.min}`
          : `${b.min}–${b.max}`,
  })),
];
---

<Base title={ui(lang).navAtlas} lang={lang} description={c("Atlante a livello di paese degli eventi documentati.", "Country-level atlas of documented events.")}>
  <h1>{c("Atlante", "Atlas")}</h1>
  <div class="max-w-3xl">
    <p>
      {c(
        "Le mappe mostrano dove sono avvenuti gli eventi della cronologia, secondo la geografia indicata nel corpus. Il luogo di un evento non indica chi ne è responsabile: autore, mandante e bersaglio sono informazioni distinte, riportate nella tabella come ruoli letterali.",
        "The maps show where timeline events took place, according to the geography given in the corpus. The location of an event does not indicate who is responsible: perpetrator, sponsor and target are distinct pieces of information, given in the table as literal roles.",
      )}
    </p>
    <p class="meta">
      {c(
        `Solo livello di paese, senza coordinate inventate. ${unplaced.length} eventi hanno una geografia sovranazionale, marittima o generica (es. «Unione europea», «Mar Baltico») e non compaiono sulla mappa. Un evento che nomina più paesi è contato in ciascuno.`,
        `Country level only, with no invented coordinates. ${unplaced.length} events have a supranational, maritime or generic geography (e.g. “European Union”, “Baltic Sea”) and do not appear on the map. An event naming several countries is counted in each.`,
      )}
    </p>
  </div>

  <ul class="flex flex-wrap gap-3 text-sm my-3" aria-label={c("Legenda: numero di eventi", "Legend: number of events")}>
    {legend.map((item) => (
      <li class="flex items-center gap-1">
        <span aria-hidden="true" class="inline-block w-4 h-4 border border-line" style={`background:${item.color}`}></span>
        {item.label}
      </li>
    ))}
  </ul>

  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2">
    {
      maps.map(({ id, title, map }) => (
        <figure>
          <figcaption class="font-semibold mb-1" id={`map-${id}`}>{title}</figcaption>
          <svg
            viewBox={`0 0 ${map.width} ${map.height}`}
            class="w-full h-auto border border-line rounded bg-[#f7f9fc]"
            role="group"
            aria-labelledby={`map-${id}`}
          >
            {map.shapes.map((shape) =>
              shape.code && shape.value > 0 ? (
                <a href={`#${shape.code}`}>
                  <path d={shape.d} fill={colorFor(shape.value)} stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="0.5">
                    <title>{`${countryName(shape.code, lang)}: ${shape.value}`}</title>
                  </path>
                </a>
              ) : (
                <path d={shape.d} fill={EMPTY_COLOR} stroke="#ffffff" stroke-width="0.5" />
              ),
            )}
          </svg>
        </figure>
      ))
    }
  </div>
  <p class="meta mt-2">
    {c("Confini: Natural Earth (pubblico dominio) tramite world-atlas.", "Borders: Natural Earth (public domain) via world-atlas.")}
  </p>

  <h2>{c("Paesi", "Countries")}</h2>
  <p class="meta max-w-3xl">
    {c(
      "«Eventi nel paese» deriva dalla geografia dell'evento. «Ruoli dello Stato» elenca i predicati originali (in italiano) con cui lo Stato compare negli eventi: includono bersagli, autorità che attribuiscono o sanzionano, contesto. Non è una misura di ostilità.",
      "“Events in the country” comes from the event geography. “Roles of the state” lists the original predicates (in Italian) with which the state appears in events: they include targets, authorities attributing or sanctioning, context. It is not a measure of hostility.",
    )}
  </p>
  <div class="relative overflow-x-auto">
    <table>
      <thead>
        <tr>
          <th scope="col">{c("Paese", "Country")}</th>
          <th scope="col">{c("Eventi nel paese", "Events in the country")}</th>
          <th scope="col">{c("Ruoli dello Stato negli eventi", "Roles of the state in events")}</th>
          <th scope="col">{c("Relazioni dirette dello Stato", "Direct relationships of the state")}</th>
        </tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        {
          rows.map((row) => (
            <tr id={row.code}>
              <th scope="row" class="font-normal">
                {countryName(row.code, lang)} <span class="meta font-mono">{row.code}</span>
                {row.state && (
                  <div class="meta">
                    <NodeLink id={row.state.id} lang={lang} />
                  </div>
                )}
              </th>
              <td>
                {row.located.length === 0 ? (
                  <span class="meta">0</span>
                ) : (
                  <details>
                    <summary class="cursor-pointer">{row.located.length}</summary>
                    <ul class="mt-1 space-y-1">
                      {row.located.map((event) => (
                        <li>
                          <span class="meta">{formatDateRange(event.date.start, event.date.end, lang)} · </span>
                          <a href={href(`events/${event.id}/`, lang)}><T text={event.title} lang={lang} /></a>
                        </li>
                      ))}
                    </ul>
                  </details>
                )}
              </td>
              <td>
                {row.roles.length === 0 ? (
                  <span class="meta">—</span>
                ) : (
                  <ul>
                    {row.roles.map((role) => (
                      <li>
                        <span lang="it">{formatPredicate(role.predicate)}</span> <span class="meta">({role.events.length})</span>
                      </li>
                    ))}
                  </ul>
                )}
              </td>
              <td>{row.state ? row.direct : <span class="meta">—</span>}</td>
            </tr>
          ))
        }
      </tbody>
    </table>
  </div>
</Base>
